{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9a419315cb500f3f","name":"Kaiburr Crystal Shard","source":{"id":"source:reference-9a419315cb500f3f","title":"Kaiburr Crystal Shard","revision":20463,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:53:53Z","sha256":"d143f8545279be572f5e457bd4f2a440368f5d3fd433070a81cffa789717fd83","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20463","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Kaiburr%20Crystal%20Shard&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9a419315cb500f3f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Color:"]}," Crimson\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["DC Modifier:"]}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A unique artifact found on the world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mimban"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mimban?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the Kaiburr Crystal glows with a sinister crimson light. The crystal has the power to amplify the flow of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," though an individual. Though the crystal itself is too large to be used in the construction of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", several shards of the crystal have been broken off over the years, and they have been used in the construction of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you wield an attuned ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," with a shard of the Kaiburr Crystal, whenever you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add to an attack roll with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", you increase the die step by one step (from d6 to d8, or d8 to d10 if you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strong in the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strong_in_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:94cdb7aeb1fa3fc3"}," feat).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
